div.p:
In the best of all worlds, promotion of human rights should stand on its own
                    merits and speak for itself. We can, however, maximize impact and understanding
                    for US policy on human rights by taking the following actions:

note.p:
Secret. The date is hand-stamped. Neither Derian nor Lake initialed the
                    memorandum. Sent through Christopher and Habib. Drafted in S/P on March 24;
                    concurred in by Nimetz.
